# (0.18) The Atari panel's attach buttons and menu; attaching or ejecting a cartridge is a
# power cycle (DESK=1; tests/mousegen.py makes tests/desk18.keys from this). Files is at
# (24, 24); its rows: BLUE.XEX y 146. The panel's content is at (171, 86). Shots (s):
#   1  10.0  BLUE.XEX dragged from Files onto the Atari icon (the executable), the icon
#            clicked: the panel, with Attach disk..., Attach cartridge..., Run program...
#            above Eject all, Restart Atari, Switch to Atari
#   2  14.5  the panel's Attach cartridge...: the dialog lists only folders and cartridges;
#            "c", Enter: into carts; "s": Star Raiders + Manual.car selected
#   3  17.0  Enter: the cartridge attached: the executable ejected, the cartridge mounted,
#            the classic machine cold booted and not shown (CB_STAY): the desktop stays
#   4  19.0  a right click in the panel: the Atari icon's menu ("Eject cartridge: ...";
#            no Open panel)
#   5  26.0  Esc; the cartridge's Eject in the panel: ejected, cold booted again (not shown;
#            late enough for the bar's free memory to have been updated)
# tests/desk18.err: the classic-machine ops of emu816's log, in order
6000 move 100 146
6400 press
6500 drag 596 100
7700 release
8500 move 596 100
8600 click
10500 move 350 258
10600 click
11500 key c
12500 key \n
13500 key s
15000 key \n
